# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 220 nm silicon slab, oxide cladding
stack core=0.22
materials clad=sio2
grating angle=10 etch=0.07
expect n_full 2.84778224 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.53934955 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.69356590 2e-07
expect group_index 3.61809536 0.0002
